{title: 589 - Holy Spirit, Gracious Guest}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #589 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 589}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Holy [C7]Spirit, [C]gracious [F]guest,
[F]Hear [Bb/F]and [C/E]grant [Dm]our [Gm]heart's [Am]request
[C]For that [C7/Bb]gift supreme [Gm]and best:
[Dm]Holy [F/C]heav'nly [Dm]love.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]Faith that [C7]mountains [C]could [F/C]remove,
[F]Tongues [Bb/F]of [C/E]earth [Dm]or heaven [Am]above,
[C]Knowledge, [C7/Bb]all things, [Dm/A]empty [Gm]prove
[Dm]If I [F/C]have no [Dm]love.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]Though I [C7]as [F/C]a [C]martyr [F]bleed,
[F]Give [Bb/F]my [C/E]goods [Dm]the [Gm]poor [Am]to [Bb]feed,
[C]All is [C7/Bb]vain if [Dm/A]love [Gm]I need:
[Dm]Therefore [F/C]give [Dm]me love.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C]Love is [C7]kind [F/C]and [C]suffers [F]long,
[F]Love [Bb/F]is [C/E]pure [Dm]and [Gm]thinks [Am]no [Bb]wrong,
[C]Love than [C7/Bb]death it [Dm/A]self [Gm]more strong:
[Dm]Therefore [F/C]give [Dm]us love.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
[C]Prophecy [F/C]will [C]fade [F/C]away,
[F]Melting [C/E]in [Dm]the [Gm]light [Am]of [Bb]day;
[C]Love will [C7/Bb]ever [Dm/A]with [Gm]us stay:
[Dm]Therefore [F/C]give [Dm]us love.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 6}
[C]Faith and [C7]hope [F/C]and [C]love [F/C]we see
[F]Joining [C/E]hand [Dm]in [Gm]hand [Am]agree-
[C]But the [C7/Bb]greatest [Dm/A]of [Gm]the three,
[Dm]And the [F/C]best is [Dm]love.
{end_of_verse}
